<view class="page">
  <!-- 顶部横幅 -->
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="hero-glow glow-1"></view>
    <view class="hero-glow glow-2"></view>
    <view class="hero-glow glow-3"></view>
    <view class="hero-bug">🐞</view>
    <view class="hero-title">虫咬识途</view>
    <view class="hero-sub">节肢动物接触安全管理助手</view>
    <view class="hero-scope">📍 当前覆盖：浙江省</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 非诊断提示 -->
  <view class="notice">
    <view class="notice-icon">⚠️</view>
    <view class="notice-text">本工具提供危险信号筛查与行动提示，不提供疾病或虫种诊断。紧急情况请直接拨打 120。</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 核心功能 -->
  <view class="funcs-head">
    <view class="funcs-title">核心功能</view>
    <view class="funcs-sub">选择一种方式开始</view>
  </view>

  <view class="func-entry" hover-class="func-entry-hover" bindtap="goPrecheck">
    <view class="func-icon">🎒</view>
    <view class="func-body">
      <view class="func-title">行前准备</view>
      <view class="func-desc">输入目的地与出行计划，获得风险提示与准备清单</view>
      <view class="func-tags">
        <text class="func-tag">风险提示</text>
        <text class="func-tag">准备清单</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="func-arrow">→</view>
  </view>

  <view class="func-entry" hover-class="func-entry-hover" bindtap="goContact">
    <view class="func-icon">🛡️</view>
    <view class="func-body">
      <view class="func-title">虫咬与接触处置</view>
      <view class="func-desc">叮咬、蜇伤、虫体附着或毒毛体液接触，先判断危险信号</view>
      <view class="func-tags">
        <text class="func-tag">危险筛查</text>
        <text class="func-tag">分步处置</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="func-arrow">→</view>
  </view>

  <view class="func-entry guide-entry" hover-class="func-entry-hover" bindtap="goInsectGuide">
    <view class="func-icon guide-icon">🔎</view>
    <view class="func-body">
      <view class="func-title">常见虫种对比图鉴</view>
      <view class="func-desc">用多张实物图对照具体物种的外形、环境与接触方式</view>
      <view class="func-tags">
        <text class="func-tag">14 个物种 · 42 张图</text>
        <text class="func-tag">2～3 种对比</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="func-arrow">→</view>
  </view>

  <view class="func-entry ai-entry" hover-class="func-entry-hover" bindtap="goAiChat">
    <view class="func-icon ai-icon">✨</view>
    <view class="func-body">
      <view class="func-title">AI建议助手</view>
      <view class="func-desc">对话咨询安全建议，可发送虫体/伤口图片和自己的事件记录</view>
      <view class="func-tags">
        <text class="func-tag">AI对话</text>
        <text class="func-tag">图片与记录</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="func-arrow">→</view>
  </view>

  <!-- 底部免责 -->
  <view class="footer-note">个人经历与AI建议不构成诊断 · 安全判断以症状和危险信号为准</view>
</view>
